<title>USA: U.S. soybean oil export breakdown.</title>
<headline>U.S. soybean oil export breakdown.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Commerce Department</p>
<p>breakdown of soybean oil exports (tonnes):</p>
<p> -			May97    Apr97    May96</p>
<p> -	   Crude    7,039   24,872   12,894</p>
<p> -  Once Refined	752    1,726	680</p>
<p> - Fully Refined    4,779   11,846   15,339</p>
<p> -  Hydrogenated	526	 45	 81</p>
<p> -	   Total   13,096   38,491   28,994</p>
